{"slug": "fyi-yachts-announces-the-sale-of-the-new-okean-57", "title": "FYI Yachts Announces the Sale of the New OKEAN 57’", "description": "FYI Yachts is thrilled to announce the successful sale of our new OKEAN 57. Delivered by Ricardo Llorente. We want to give a special thanks...", "date": "2024-07-02", "category": "Blog", "image": "https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/07/FYI-Yachts-Announces-the-Sale-of-the-New-OKEAN-57.png", "html": "<a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/07/FYI-Yachts-Announces-the-Sale-of-the-New-OKEAN-57.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/fyiyachts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FYI Yachts</a> is thrilled to announce the successful sale of our new OKEAN 57’. Delivered by <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/consultants/ricardo-llorente/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ricardo Llorente</a>. We want to give a special thanks to Katia Fernandes, Manuel Pires, and the entire OKEAN team for their assistance in making this deal happen for our buyer.The OKEAN 57’ features a spacious design that feels even larger thanks to its open decks, allowing for close and comfortable experiences with the sea. The bow can be customized to include a jacuzzi and lounge area. The AFT deck boasts a lateral seating area, swim platform, and freshwater shower. The yacht comfortably accommodates 4 guests in 2 cabins, including a lower deck lounge area.This marks a new beginning for OKEAN Yachts and FYI Yachts partnership in the USA. Ricardo Llorente, the broker behind this sale, expressed his excitement: “This sale is a testament to the excellence of this outstanding 2024 57’ OKEAN and our commitment to providing clients with extraordinary experiences. This 57’ OKEAN is a masterpiece that sets new standards in luxury yachting. It also excited us to be part of another amazing sale with the OKEAN team”<p>Explore our available <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/okean-yachts-for-sale/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OKEAN models</a> and find your dream vessel today. <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/yachts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Click here to browse our selection.</a></p><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/07/FYI-Yachts-Announces-the-Sale-of-the-New-OKEAN-57.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/07/FYI-Yachts-Announces-the-Sale-of-the-New-OKEAN-57.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/07/FYI-Yachts-Announces-the-Sale-of-the-New-OKEAN-57-1.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/07/FYI-Yachts-Announces-the-Sale-of-the-New-OKEAN-57-1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/07/FYI-Yachts-Announces-the-Sale-of-the-New-OKEAN-57-2.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/07/FYI-Yachts-Announces-the-Sale-of-the-New-OKEAN-57-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><br/><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/07/FYI-Yachts-Announces-the-Sale-of-the-New-OKEAN-57-3.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/07/FYI-Yachts-Announces-the-Sale-of-the-New-OKEAN-57-3.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/07/FYI-Yachts-Announces-the-Sale-of-the-New-OKEAN-57-4.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/07/FYI-Yachts-Announces-the-Sale-of-the-New-OKEAN-57-4.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/07/FYI-Yachts-Announces-the-Sale-of-the-New-OKEAN-57-5.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://sto